* op_dispatch -- runs a value through a fixed add/subtract/multiply/divide chain 1000 times.
* bottleneck: arithmetic operator dispatch and predicate test.
        m = 1
        i = 1
loop    m = m + 3
        m = m - 1
        m = m * 2
        m = GE(m, 1000000) m / 1000
        i = LT(i, 1000) i + 1                           :S(loop)
        OUTPUT = 'after 1000 passes = ' m
END
